<ul><li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Endless%20reboot%20cycles%20after%20install%20under%20Windows%20XP%20SP%202" title="Bug: Endless reboot cycles after install under Windows XP SP 2">Bug: Endless reboot cycles after install under Windows XP SP 2</a></li>
