<li><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Bug%20-%20Installer%20hangs%20at%20the%20stage%20of%20Execute%20-%20regsvr32.exe%20-%20s%20-%20C%20-%20Dragon%20Age%20-%20tools%20-%20Engine.dll" title="Bug: Installer hangs at the stage of Execute:regsvr32.exe /s &quot;C:\Dragon Age\tools\Engine.dll&quot;">Bug: Installer hangs at the stage of Execute:regsvr32.exe /s "C:\Dragon Age\tools\Engine.dll"</a></li>
